{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05699","headline":"九日侍宴应制 · 崔国辅","name":"九日侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"运偶千年圣，时传九日神。\n尧樽列钟鼓，汉阙辟钩陈。\n金籙三清降，琼筵五老巡。\n始惊兰佩出，复咏柏梁新。\n云鴈楼前晚，霜花酒里春。\n欢娱无限极，书劒太平人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔国辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}